# .env.example — committed template for app-runtime secrets.
#
# Seeded by `agenticd init`. This repo owns this file once seeded — init never
# overwrites it. Copy it to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in real values.
#
# `.env` holds secrets the APPLICATION consumes at runtime (database URLs, API keys,
# JWT secrets). External CLI tool tokens (Sentry / Turbo / Cloudflare / …) go in
# `.config/mise.local.toml` instead — keep the two patterns separate.
#
# Replace these placeholders with your project's real variables:

# DATABASE_URL=
# JWT_SECRET=
